# Build-context filter for the repo root: the sandbox/Dockerfile.test context and
# sandbox/Dockerfile's named context switchboard-src (docs/SANDBOX.md). An allowlist:
# only what the build and the test suite need goes in, so gitignored local files
# (logs, databases, target/, node_modules/, .env files) never reach an image.
*
!src/
!tests/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!sandbox/run-tests.sh
# the two-host image (sandbox/Dockerfile.twohost): the remote's entrypoint and the bench stand-ins
!sandbox/twohost/entrypoint-pi.sh
!sandbox/twohost/bench/
# ...and, inside those, nothing local (mirrors .gitignore)
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/logs
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/.switchboard*
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
tests/live/_runs
